CORE
contract.sol
--contract MultKey --solidity-path-coverage --solidity-max-tx 2 --focus-function put,take --path-cov-instrument-only take
^--solidity-path-coverage: instrumented 4 complete path\(s\) across 1 unit\(s\)
^Claim Multiplicity: 1 extra solve\(s\) beyond the first across all keys; worst key 'take:path:\d+[^']*' decided 2 time\(s\); ceiling not enforced \(--path-cov-max-claim-solves unset\); 1 decided verdict\(s\) superseded by a different decided verdict
^Path Status: F 4, I 0, U 0
^COVERAGE ANALYSIS COMPLETE$
\A(?!(.|\n)*INTERNAL DEFECT)
